{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16955","headline":"顺宗至德大圣皇帝挽歌词三首 三 · 武元衡","name":"顺宗至德大圣皇帝挽歌词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"哀挽渭川曲，空歌汾水阳。\n夜泉愁更咽，秋日惨无光。\n缵夏功传啓，兴周业继昌。\n回瞻五陵上，烟雨爲苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}